este qui devient une <em>habitude</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "c7dfd6ac36aeeb76f0d608a86269229fa832d1e1fddf12df390ea20d9ae2e444"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.titulo:3bxlgz367q3mg", "value": "Um pequeno gesto que se torna um <em>hábito</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "c7dfd6ac36aeeb76f0d608a86269229fa832d1e1fddf12df390ea20d9ae2e444"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.texto:1ecms4ow0juz9", "value": "Allumez une bougie, installez-vous confortablement et offrez-vous quinze minutes. Rizelune transforme un geste aussi simple que votre shampooing en un petit rituel de soin.", "translatableContentDigest": "0ac43e63979e299c6dba6b0a2f5d298647d3b187e7daabdac4a101eef1ecc9f2"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.texto:1ecms4ow0juz9", "value": "Acenda uma vela, fique confortável e ofereça a si mesma quinze minutos. O Rizelune transforma algo tão simples como lavar o cabelo num pequeno ritual de cuidado.", "translatableContentDigest": "0ac43e63979e299c6dba6b0a2f5d298647d3b187e7daabdac4a101eef1ecc9f2"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.lista:1ecms4tu6b3lw", "value": "Cuir chevelu nourri et sensation de fraîcheur\nDes cheveux plus forts dès la racine\nUn éclat sain qui se voit", "translatableContentDigest": "12e1dc84a35e5e6809f6d44c13058253c571b9a67179fcf9524ca9503ae20464"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.lista:1ecms4tu6b3lw", "value": "Couro cabeludo nutrido e com sensação de frescura\nCabelo com mais força desde a raiz\nUm brilho saudável que se nota", "translatableContentDigest": "12e1dc84a35e5e6809f6d44c13058253c571b9a67179fcf9524ca9503ae20464"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.boton:1ecms4uwsne7z", "value": "Commencer mon rituel", "translatableContentDigest": "3da36b337f81cc11fc2aa4fb16959d293075a24d3718c706b7827d3335f6aac4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.ritual.boton:1ecms4uwsne7z", "value": "Começar o meu ritual", "translatableContentDigest": "3da36b337f81cc11fc2aa4fb16959d293075a24d3718c706b7827d3335f6aac4"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.resenas.eyebrow:1r1kmj6tbabjw", "value": "Avis", "translatableContentDigest": "55922468babb8b370310870a838a54734b14ac439b211573aa5b3396fa5c9274"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.resenas.eyebrow:1r1kmj6tbabjw", "value": "Opiniões", "translatableContentDigest": "55922468babb8b370310870a838a54734b14ac439b211573aa5b3396fa5c9274"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.resenas.titulo:vn0bgzy0m6mq", "value": "Ce qu'en disent celles qui ont déjà leur <em>rituel</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "fa1d06afd7577a699637f2d02fd2531a309334d9ab1632e9aecfe86233265508"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.resenas.titulo:vn0bgzy0m6mq", "value": "O que dizem as clientes que já têm o seu <em>ritual</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "fa1d06afd7577a699637f2d02fd2531a309334d9ab1632e9aecfe86233265508"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.eyebrow:1qok4ayf6xpef", "value": "Questions", "translatableContentDigest": "4b9a4c9ba82557a102268f75382ce489e0115d8313326923a51485c16bac82d4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.eyebrow:1qok4ayf6xpef", "value": "Dúvidas", "translatableContentDigest": "4b9a4c9ba82557a102268f75382ce489e0115d8313326923a51485c16bac82d4"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.titulo:38kfcpzcwq02h", "value": "Questions <em>fréquentes</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "4c87fb056a7cb3c40a13c9239295eef5895d0baa245836af3866f9a7154f5a72"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.titulo:38kfcpzcwq02h", "value": "Perguntas <em>frequentes</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "4c87fb056a7cb3c40a13c9239295eef5895d0baa245836af3866f9a7154f5a72"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f1.pregunta:glwoapxqjiuc", "value": "Comment utiliser Rizelune ?", "translatableContentDigest": "58a5a1a49092bfe90870d621b89aedfe457be7f5c959e031a82512c564445523"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f1.pregunta:glwoapxqjiuc", "value": "Como se usa o Rizelune?", "translatableContentDigest": "58a5a1a49092bfe90870d621b89aedfe457be7f5c959e031a82512c564445523"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f1.respuesta:3jlos18517vxk", "value": "<p>Appliquez quelques gouttes sur le cuir chevelu et les cheveux, massez du bout des doigts et laissez agir au moins 15 minutes. Lavez ensuite vos cheveux comme d'habitude.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c0f3c2e81bca4aba76b81335ddcc6bbcdb95e4d8ff9c02f9a9a49c57ad6e746d"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f1.respuesta:3jlos18517vxk", "value": "<p>Aplique umas gotas no couro cabeludo e no cabelo, massaje com as pontas dos dedos e deixe atuar pelo menos 15 minutos. Depois lave o cabelo como de costume.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c0f3c2e81bca4aba76b81335ddcc6bbcdb95e4d8ff9c02f9a9a49c57ad6e746d"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f2.pregunta:3dwlyd6uboe3r", "value": "À quelle fréquence l'appliquer ?", "translatableContentDigest": "1a2b83d96cdc0cb0b17222e406ba71e4119fcdba775192cd763e40a91db69aa9"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f2.pregunta:3dwlyd6uboe3r", "value": "Com que frequência devo aplicar?", "translatableContentDigest": "1a2b83d96cdc0cb0b17222e406ba71e4119fcdba775192cd763e40a91db69aa9"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f2.respuesta:2qpth5gahm1zf", "value": "<p>Nous recommandons de l'utiliser 1 à 2 fois par semaine. C'est la régularité qui fait la différence.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6870d37fb9260d6506aea21d9f01d3f95cb537bce7d607d07aebcacd9f8c520"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f2.respuesta:2qpth5gahm1zf", "value": "<p>Recomendamos usá-lo 1–2 vezes por semana. A constância é o que faz a diferença.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6870d37fb9260d6506aea21d9f01d3f95cb537bce7d607d07aebcacd9f8c520"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f3.pregunta:ikov9tjwo27a", "value": "Va-t-il graisser mes cheveux ?", "translatableContentDigest": "87b83cb6a3cbd70c5efa2b67ef517da4f63187bcfba4ba60998f8cc542d7a414"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f3.pregunta:ikov9tjwo27a", "value": "Vai deixar o cabelo oleoso?", "translatableContentDigest": "87b83cb6a3cbd70c5efa2b67ef517da4f63187bcfba4ba60998f8cc542d7a414"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f3.respuesta:1gaipft1pkj3e", "value": "<p>Non, car il s'applique <strong>avant</strong> le shampooing. Après l'avoir laissé agir, vous lavez vos cheveux comme d'habitude et il s'élimine.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3fe6571811042e2efb1dcfc420dd448bb865c1c7bd16c4e9196bb44b9669b5f2"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f3.respuesta:1gaipft1pkj3e", "value": "<p>Não, porque se aplica <strong>antes</strong> da lavagem. Depois de o deixar atuar, lava o cabelo como sempre e sai.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3fe6571811042e2efb1dcfc420dd448bb865c1c7bd16c4e9196bb44b9669b5f2"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f4.pregunta:20ioy3x9wq9gh", "value": "Est-il vegan ?", "translatableContentDigest": "3be62f76245aa20574f3d452de14364c9a8c1b6065b9e400f7b74e23b1aa348e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f4.pregunta:20ioy3x9wq9gh", "value": "É vegano?", "translatableContentDigest": "3be62f76245aa20574f3d452de14364c9a8c1b6065b9e400f7b74e23b1aa348e"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f4.respuesta:ankjgkhivuml", "value": "<p>Oui. Sa formule est naturelle et vegan, fabriquée dans l'UE avec certification qualité.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4aec1c6e188fe1d90698ffc30316fce480b4d44eeed63e7bdef153154eed2e1c"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f4.respuesta:ankjgkhivuml", "value": "<p>Sim. A sua fórmula é natural e vegana, fabricada na UE com certificação de qualidade.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4aec1c6e188fe1d90698ffc30316fce480b4d44eeed63e7bdef153154eed2e1c"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f5.pregunta:31c5w1m5miecg", "value": "Quelle est la taille du flacon ?", "translatableContentDigest": "9218e0a8350704b610dfe486d54a5b4bc35def5e526102a3a37983dc22fc6331"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f5.pregunta:31c5w1m5miecg", "value": "Qual é o tamanho do frasco?", "translatableContentDigest": "9218e0a8350704b610dfe486d54a5b4bc35def5e526102a3a37983dc22fc6331"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f5.respuesta:2wdnsrzevmsj0", "value": "<p>30 ml, avec compte-gouttes pour doser juste ce qu'il faut, sans gaspiller.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8adcbade9d406c868ce772e46f82056620c4a046e1f468f0113de1e64fd6a6c2"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f5.respuesta:2wdnsrzevmsj0", "value": "<p>30 ml, com conta-gotas para dosear apenas o que precisa, sem desperdício.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8adcbade9d406c868ce772e46f82056620c4a046e1f468f0113de1e64fd6a6c2"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f6.pregunta:22hh530w2ustf", "value": "Quelle est son odeur ?", "translatableContentDigest": "b0681211024033207afa0f45d9d920ba9448f04adc631143205d9ca9da430b1e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f6.pregunta:22hh530w2ustf", "value": "A que cheira?", "translatableContentDigest": "b0681211024033207afa0f45d9d920ba9448f04adc631143205d9ca9da430b1e"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f6.respuesta:23hshw7kc0ykv", "value": "<p>Le romarin et la menthe : un parfum herbacé et frais, avec une touche de fraîcheur sur le cuir chevelu grâce à la menthe.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "d4952b60ee498b6ade478e7c38ef9428e13f6d466f9bd08522c7b17fb802de22"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f6.respuesta:23hshw7kc0ykv", "value": "<p>Cheira a alecrim e hortelã-pimenta: um aroma herbal e fresco, com um toque de frescura no couro cabeludo graças à hortelã-pimenta.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "d4952b60ee498b6ade478e7c38ef9428e13f6d466f9bd08522c7b17fb802de22"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f7.pregunta:33ay30prsmxpe", "value": "Combien coûte la livraison et quel est le délai ?", "translatableContentDigest": "57069fcbf1a723a7ecb430d326df3942dbf097c8f9e3eaea360c8da76afe32c4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f7.pregunta:33ay30prsmxpe", "value": "Quanto custa o envio e quanto tempo demora?", "translatableContentDigest": "57069fcbf1a723a7ecb430d326df3942dbf097c8f9e3eaea360c8da76afe32c4"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f7.respuesta:t2hq6kbjzfou", "value": "<p><strong>France et Portugal :</strong> 6 € (ou seulement 2,99 € dès 39,99 € d'achat). Livraison en 8 jours ouvrés environ en France et 11 au Portugal.</p><p><strong>Espagne :</strong> livraison <strong>gratuite</strong> dès 39,99 € (sinon 6,99 €), en 10 jours ouvrés environ.</p><p>Vous recevrez un e-mail avec le numéro de suivi. Plus d'informations dans notre <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">politique de livraison</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c032682077894683fb524ed9f5c5589c095e9fe2623c3c29c50ae1dd2c029c3f"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f7.respuesta:t2hq6kbjzfou", "value": "<p><strong>Portugal e França:</strong> 6 € (ou apenas 2,99 € a partir de 39,99 €). Chega em cerca de 11 dias úteis a Portugal e 8 a França.</p><p><strong>Espanha:</strong> envio <strong>grátis</strong> a partir de 39,99 € (caso contrário, 6,99 €), em cerca de 10 dias úteis.</p><p>Receberá um e-mail com o número de seguimento. Mais informações na nossa <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">política de envio</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c032682077894683fb524ed9f5c5589c095e9fe2623c3c29c50ae1dd2c029c3f"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f8.pregunta:1hh5hsrflebn1", "value": "Puis-je le retourner ?", "translatableContentDigest": "122be472b5deda3ddbdaf661eca8ce2b508245a28cad5f5260cfdcdbc1326aa3"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f8.pregunta:1hh5hsrflebn1", "value": "Posso devolvê-lo?", "translatableContentDigest": "122be472b5deda3ddbdaf661eca8ce2b508245a28cad5f5260cfdcdbc1326aa3"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f8.respuesta:2azl6mz1oussh", "value": "<p>Oui. Vous disposez de 14 jours à compter de la réception pour demander un retour. Consultez toutes les conditions dans notre <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">politique de retour</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ce7809b9773fcc8740f2e2ba28601780dc8fd4d0d8560122f4462b70f9def585"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.faq.f8.respuesta:2azl6mz1oussh", "value": "<p>Sim. Tem 14 dias desde que o recebe para solicitar a devolução. Consulte todas as condições na nossa <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">política de devoluções</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ce7809b9773fcc8740f2e2ba28601780dc8fd4d0d8560122f4462b70f9def585"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.eyebrow:bwp9ip6pdnz7", "value": "Commencez aujourd'hui", "translatableContentDigest": "5ff0ba1b0d34a25611b66e5611c5d329756a7fe3c09d081d1e238eefb7c3ce5e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.eyebrow:bwp9ip6pdnz7", "value": "Comece hoje", "translatableContentDigest": "5ff0ba1b0d34a25611b66e5611c5d329756a7fe3c09d081d1e238eefb7c3ce5e"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.titulo:1fbof6g7z5cz1", "value": "Votre rituel commence ce soir", "translatableContentDigest": "14f43e7e1e920f13d8d3f5a11a66d83c5b7453fcd075c768dfa5e7873c7e407a"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.titulo:1fbof6g7z5cz1", "value": "O seu ritual começa esta noite", "translatableContentDigest": "14f43e7e1e920f13d8d3f5a11a66d83c5b7453fcd075c768dfa5e7873c7e407a"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.texto:zj452n1matq8", "value": "Nourrit, fortifie et illumine vos cheveux dès la racine avec un rituel de seulement 15 minutes.", "translatableContentDigest": "6af586a962300f01c14486c8ed7d0e4cd606c82704fea58ebdce77e1e189c439"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.texto:zj452n1matq8", "value": "Nutre, fortalece e ilumina o seu cabelo desde a raiz com um ritual de apenas 15 minutos.", "translatableContentDigest": "6af586a962300f01c14486c8ed7d0e4cd606c82704fea58ebdce77e1e189c439"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.etiqueta:34odufkad72zi", "value": "Promo !", "translatableContentDigest": "92cfc962436fab38d2eea4fa91bef6fb4b31959a0f5282b5c95ace8640d14fb4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.etiqueta:34odufkad72zi", "value": "Promoção!", "translatableContentDigest": "92cfc962436fab38d2eea4fa91bef6fb4b31959a0f5282b5c95ace8640d14fb4"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.lista:zj4528wbgyvl", "value": "Flacon compte-gouttes de 30 ml\nHuile de romarin et menthe\nFormule naturelle et vegan, fabriquée dans l'UE\nLivraison à 2,99 € dès 39,99 €", "translatableContentDigest": "bd85b26cd89a076ad84cb617b1409da1db26b950a24f5d9bb532ff386308754a"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.lista:zj4528wbgyvl", "value": "Frasco conta-gotas de 30 ml\nÓleo de alecrim e hortelã-pimenta\nFórmula natural e vegana, fabricada na UE\nEnvio a 2,99 € a partir de 39,99 €", "translatableContentDigest": "bd85b26cd89a076ad84cb617b1409da1db26b950a24f5d9bb532ff386308754a"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.boton:zj452eku44bu", "value": "Ajouter au panier", "translatableContentDigest": "983bb7f281a14c3ef453756cb1ab29fd3d23cac67b8679fb8e1d0c88684cd704"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.boton:zj452eku44bu", "value": "Adicionar ao carrinho", "translatableContentDigest": "983bb7f281a14c3ef453756cb1ab29fd3d23cac67b8679fb8e1d0c88684cd704"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.index.json.compra.ver_mas:bwpjsu21wb03", "value": "Voir tous les détails", "translatableContentDigest": "d8e94bf9ecd14a455b53e5a8d351869d41f954ab278821c084256779d754ccbb"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.compra.ver_mas:bwpjsu21wb03", "value": "Ver todo